    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "reasoning": "The student is experiencing exam panic. I need to de-escalate, validate their feelings, and guide them to focus on the text rather than the fear. I will start by asking them to look at the word 'return' in the title.",
      "content": "Take a deep breath. It is completely normal to feel overwhelmed, but we can break this down together, one step at a time. You don't need to see the whole answer right now. Let's look at the title: 'Poem of Return'. If someone is 'returning' from 'exile and silence' (as mentioned in line 1), what does that tell you about where they have been and how they might feel about their home?"
